      <activity id="44b37e95-398e-5125-b714-cb29dccc69a9" activityNameId="50308c2c-46cc-51ef-bcbc-c3f6b47f7c7b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Potato seed IP, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potato seed IP, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of potato seed (fresh weight), with an average dry matter content of 22%;
UUID: 72a18df5-b020-3620-b62e-5461f94584a0
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing (for integrated production) and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. No data on wastewater production were available. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Refers to average seed processing
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: Consumption of potato seed in Switzerland is 61'450 t/year, 8% imported
Sampling: Data based on a literature, expert information and enquiry of seed processing plants. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_72a18df5-b020-3620-b62e-5461f94584a0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
